# Jak II's pause menu Multiplayer (LIST-0.1.7 item 1). As jak2_pause_turned.sim to play at the fortress exit, then Start
# (the pause menu), the right hand pointing away, the left stick down three times (Missions, Show Map, Highscores, Game
# Options) and A: Game Options, its first row VR Options; down once and A: the Multiplayer page (log `[vr-mp] pause
# Multiplayer: Host Game, Join Game`; pmp-mp, its two rows). B: back to Game Options (pmp-back); Start: play again
# (pmp-play), no session (no `[mp-session]` line). On C:\JakQuest\sim\gkcfg-mpoff ("multiplayer off"): no Multiplayer row,
# so the same down and A opens the next row (Multiplayer Options greyed is gone too: Input Options) and no `[vr-mp]`
# line.
